Package: twoStep2Phase
Title: Two-Step Estimation for Two-Phase Studies
Version: 0.0.25
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Q.", family = "Zhou", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "qzhou8@charlotte.edu"),
    person(given = "K. Y.", family = "Wong", role = "aut", email = "kin-yau.wong@polyu.edu.hk")
  )
Author: Q. Zhou [aut, cre],
    K. Y. Wong [aut]
Maintainer: Q. Zhou <qzhou8@charlotte.edu>
Description: Utilities and prototype estimators for the two-step update
    estimation approach described in "An optimal two-step estimation approach
    for two-phase studies". The package wraps the supplied simulation code into
    reusable functions for linear, logistic, and Cox outcomes with an expensive
    covariate, an auxiliary variable, optional cheap covariates, and two-phase
    sampling.
